# Prettier's default glob (`.`) touches everything under the repo. Scope it
# to the source code this project actually wants formatted, and exclude
# files owned by other tools that rewrite them in their own style:
# release-please's own outputs (fighting them fails CI on every release),
# and generic project conventions (workflow YAML, docs, README, fixtures)
# that shouldn't be silently reformatted alongside a printWidth change.
CHANGELOG.md
.release-please-manifest.json
.github/
docs/
README.md
